WEBVTT

00:09:59.511 --> 00:10:00.804
to create.

00:10:01.138 --> 00:10:02.806
Everyone froze.

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:07.061
Then, slowly but surely,
people started to create.

00:10:07.102 --> 00:10:08.854
And by the end of the session,

00:10:08.896 --> 00:10:13.192
their faces were lighting up
as they shared their creations

00:10:13.192 --> 00:10:14.693
with the rest of the group.

00:10:15.235 --> 00:10:17.655
And it reminded me that as adults,

00:10:17.696 --> 00:10:22.284
we have to let go of our expectation
that we get it right.

00:10:23.369 --> 00:10:28.040
Because if we opt out of play,

00:10:28.082 --> 00:10:32.419
based on what we know
about how important our interactions are